      "whey protein hydrolysate",
      "hydrolyzed whey vs isolate",
      "degree of hydrolysis",
      "pre-digested whey"
    ],
  }}
  jsonLd={schema}
>
  <article class="relative overflow-hidden">
    <ArticleHeader kicker={"Buyer's Guide"} badge={"Label-Checked"} author={author} dates={dates} mobileAd={false}>
      <Fragment slot="title">Best Hydrolyzed Whey Protein</Fragment>
      Hydrolyzed whey is whey that has been partly broken down before you drink it. It costs more and tastes more bitter, so here is what it actually does, who it helps, and the powders that contain enough of it to matter.
