    <TableOfContents>
      <a href="#quick-compare">Quick Comparison</a>
      <a href="#top-picks">Our Top Picks</a>
      <a href="#what-is-it">What Is Hydrolyzed Whey?</a>
      <a href="#degree">Degree of Hydrolysis</a>
