                  For most people, Dymatize ISO100. It pairs hydrolyzed whey isolate with regular isolate for 25 g of protein in about 110 to 120 calories per the label, and it costs about what a standard isolate does. Optimum Nutrition Platinum Hydrowhey is the pick if you want hydrolysate as the main protein, and Rule 1 R1 is the value option.
                </p>
